      "id": "add-dependencies-576abc",
      "name": "AddDependencies",
      "category": "SwarmInterface",
      "signature": "AddDependencies(Target, New Dependencies, New Dependency Count)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FTaskSpecification*"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Dependencies",
          "type": "TCHAR**"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Dependency Count",
          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Used to add channel dependencies to a Task. When an Agent runs this Task,\nit will ensure that all dependencies are satisfied prior to giving the\nTask to the requester.\n@param NewDependencies The list of additional dependent channel names\n@param NewDependencyCount The number of elements in the NewDependencies list"
    },
    {
      "id": "add-dependencies-bd4395",
      "name": "AddDependencies",
      "category": "SwarmInterface",
      "signature": "AddDependencies(Target, New Required Dependencies, New Required Dependency Count, New Optional Dependencies, New Optional Dependency Count)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FJobSpecification*"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Required Dependencies",
          "type": "TCHAR**"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Required Dependency Count",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Optional Dependencies",
          "type": "TCHAR**"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Optional Dependency Count",
          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Used to add channel dependencies to a Job. When an Agent runs this Job,\nit will ensure that all dependencies are satisfied prior to launching\nthe executable. Note that the Job executable is an implied dependency.\n@param NewRequiredDependencies The list of additional required dependent channel names\n@param NewRequiredDependencyCount The number of elements in the NewRequiredDependencies list\n@param NewOptionalDependencies The list of additional optional dependent channel names\n@param NewOptionalDependencyCount The number of elements in the NewOptionalDependencies list"
    },
